#--------------------------------------------------------------- 4 24-game-solve
This will attempt to find solutions to 24 for sets of numbers by
combining 4 single digits between 1 and 9 to make 24 using only + - * / and ( ).
All operations have equal precedence and are evaluated left to right.
Enter 'use n1 n2 n3 n4' or just hit enter (to use a random set),'first'/'all' shows the first or all solutions, 'quit' to end.
#--------------------------------------------------------------------- 5 24-game
Welcome to 24

Combine the 4 given digits to make 24 using only + - * / and ( ).
 All operations have equal precedence and are evaluated left to right.
Combining (concatenating) digits is not allowed.
Enter 'help', 'quit', or an expression.

Your four digits are : 3 5 4 6 
